  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "create-dsh-app",
      "text": "> **1-Line AI Agent Generator for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`)**\n\n[](LICENSE)\n[](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)\n\nScaffold a production-ready, autonomous AI agent powered by **DeepSeek Harness** in seconds with pre-wired MCP tools, long-term memory, and web browsing.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "⚡ Quickstart",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "1-Line Scaffolding",
      "text": "npx create-dsh-app my-agent"
    },
    {
      "section": "Enter project directory",
      "text": "cd my-agent"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install dependencies and start",
      "text": "npm install\ncp .env.example .env\nnpm start\n```\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🧩 Included Out-of-the-Box",
      "text": "Each generated project comes pre-configured with:\n- 🔌 **`dsh-plugin-mcp`**: Universal Model Context Protocol tools & 1-click server catalog (GitHub, Postgres, SQLite, Brave Search, etc.)\n- 🧠 **`dsh-plugin-memory`**: Persistent long-term knowledge graph & user preference recall\n- 🌐 **`dsh-plugin-browser`**: Native headless web browser navigation & Markdown extraction\n- ⚡ **TypeScript & Cordis Lifecycle**: Clean architecture with fast hot-reloading (`tsx`)\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "Options",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "Exclude specific plugins if not needed:",
      "text": "npx create-dsh-app my-minimal-agent --no-browser --no-memory\n```\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT © DeepSeek Harness Community\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🤝 Contributing",
      "text": "Contributions are warmly welcome! Whether you are reporting an issue, proposing an adapter, optimizing performance, or fixing a bug, please check out our [Contributing Guide](CONTRIBUTING.md).\n\n1. Fork the Project\n2. Create your Feature Branch (`git checkout -b feat/AmazingFeature`)\n3. Commit your Changes (`git commit -m 'feat: add some AmazingFeature'`)\n4. Push to the Branch (`git push origin feat/AmazingFeature`)\n5. Open a [Pull Request](https://github.com/menotbobbybrown/create-dsh-app/pulls)"
    },
